{"page":306,"width":1659,"height":2480,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"364","words":[{"text":"364","x":170,"y":134,"width":56,"height":26}]},{"text":"Chapter 8 교착 상대","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":294,"y":135,"width":114,"height":27},{"text":"8","x":421,"y":137,"width":20,"height":21},{"text":"교착","x":468,"y":136,"width":42,"height":23},{"text":"상대","x":518,"y":136,"width":40,"height":24}]},{"text":"Linux LOCKDEP 도구","words":[{"text":"Linux","x":709,"y":294,"width":89,"height":27},{"text":"LOCKDEP","x":808,"y":292,"width":172,"height":28},{"text":"도구","x":990,"y":290,"width":64,"height":33}]},{"text":"자원을 올바른 순서로 확보하는 것은 커널 및 프로그램 개발자의 책임이지","words":[{"text":"자원을","x":331,"y":364,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"올바른","x":437,"y":365,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"순서로","x":540,"y":366,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"확보하는","x":643,"y":365,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"것은","x":777,"y":363,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"커널","x":849,"y":362,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"및","x":922,"y":362,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"프로그램","x":1043,"y":362,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"개발자의","x":1186,"y":361,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"책임이지","x":1335,"y":359,"width":126,"height":35}]},{"text":"만 락이 올바른 순서로 획득되었는지 김중히는 데 특정 소프트웨어가 시용될 수 있","words":[{"text":"만","x":332,"y":421,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"락이","x":374,"y":421,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"올바른","x":443,"y":421,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"순서로","x":543,"y":421,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"획득되었는지","x":643,"y":420,"width":170,"height":36},{"text":"김중히는","x":830,"y":417,"width":117,"height":37},{"text":"데","x":958,"y":418,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"특정","x":998,"y":418,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"소프트웨어가","x":1072,"y":416,"width":195,"height":37},{"text":"시용될","x":1277,"y":416,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1389,"y":416,"width":34,"height":34},{"text":"있","x":1436,"y":415,"width":30,"height":35}]},{"text":"다. 가능한 교착 상태를 감지하기 위해 Linux는 커널 내의 락킹 순서를 검증하는","words":[{"text":"다.","x":332,"y":477,"width":37,"height":35},{"text":"가능한","x":384,"y":477,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"교착","x":485,"y":477,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"상태를","x":557,"y":477,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"감지하기","x":659,"y":475,"width":112,"height":37},{"text":"위해","x":788,"y":475,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"Linux는","x":858,"y":476,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"커널","x":992,"y":474,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"내의","x":1067,"y":474,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"락킹","x":1144,"y":474,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"순서를","x":1221,"y":473,"width":101,"height":34},{"text":"검증하는","x":1337,"y":472,"width":130,"height":34}]},{"text":"데 사용될 수 있는 다양한 기능을 갖춘 도구인 lockdep을 제공한다. lockdep은","words":[{"text":"데","x":333,"y":533,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"사용될","x":374,"y":533,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":476,"y":534,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"있는","x":520,"y":533,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"다양한","x":590,"y":533,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"기능을","x":692,"y":533,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"갖춘","x":792,"y":532,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"도구인","x":861,"y":531,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"lockdep을","x":963,"y":531,"width":164,"height":37},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1141,"y":529,"width":137,"height":36},{"text":"lockdep은","x":1295,"y":529,"width":172,"height":36}]},{"text":"락 획득 및 해제 규칙을 기준으로 락 획득 및 해제의 시용 패턴을 감시하기 때문에","words":[{"text":"락","x":331,"y":589,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"획득","x":374,"y":588,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"및","x":445,"y":590,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"해제","x":485,"y":590,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"규칙을","x":555,"y":589,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"기준으로","x":656,"y":589,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"락","x":783,"y":589,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"획득","x":824,"y":589,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"및","x":896,"y":588,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"해제의","x":936,"y":587,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"시용","x":1039,"y":587,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"패턴을","x":1115,"y":587,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"감시하기","x":1224,"y":585,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"때문에","x":1371,"y":585,"width":94,"height":35}]},{"text":"실행 중인 커널에서 활성화되도록 설계되었다. 디음으로 두 가지 예를 제시하지만","words":[{"text":"실행","x":331,"y":645,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"중인","x":403,"y":646,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"커널에서","x":477,"y":645,"width":112,"height":35},{"text":"활성화되도록","x":604,"y":645,"width":178,"height":35},{"text":"설계되었다.","x":794,"y":644,"width":154,"height":35},{"text":"디음으로","x":963,"y":644,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"두","x":1099,"y":646,"width":33,"height":32},{"text":"가지","x":1145,"y":644,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"예를","x":1225,"y":643,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"제시하지만","x":1304,"y":642,"width":165,"height":35}]},{"text":"lockdep은 여기에 설명된 것보다 훨씬 더 많은 기능을 제공한다.","words":[{"text":"lockdep은","x":330,"y":703,"width":158,"height":36},{"text":"여기에","x":499,"y":702,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"설명된","x":597,"y":701,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"것보다","x":696,"y":701,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"훨씬","x":793,"y":700,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"더","x":863,"y":700,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"많은","x":902,"y":700,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"기능을","x":975,"y":700,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1078,"y":700,"width":136,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 학이 획득되는 순서는 시스템에 의해 동적으로 유지된다. lockdep가 순서대","words":[{"text":"•","x":349,"y":797,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"학이","x":385,"y":787,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"획득되는","x":459,"y":787,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"순서는","x":589,"y":786,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"시스템에","x":691,"y":785,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"의해","x":823,"y":785,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"동적으로","x":895,"y":785,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"유지된다.","x":1031,"y":785,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"lockdep가","x":1183,"y":785,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"순서대","x":1372,"y":784,"width":95,"height":35}]},{"text":"로 획득되지 않은 락을 감지하면 교착 상태가 기능하다고 보고한다.","words":[{"text":"로","x":384,"y":848,"width":31,"height":25},{"text":"획득되지","x":426,"y":844,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"않은","x":555,"y":844,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"락을","x":624,"y":843,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"감지하면","x":692,"y":842,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"교착","x":821,"y":842,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"상태가","x":890,"y":842,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"기능하다고","x":994,"y":842,"width":158,"height":35},{"text":"보고한다.","x":1163,"y":843,"width":140,"height":34}]},{"text":"• Linux에서 스핀락은 인터럽트 핸들러에서 시용될 수 있다. 커널이 인터럽트","words":[{"text":"•","x":347,"y":920,"width":14,"height":14},{"text":"Linux에서","x":383,"y":911,"width":146,"height":34},{"text":"스핀락은","x":546,"y":910,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"인터럽트","x":680,"y":909,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"핸들러에서","x":811,"y":909,"width":147,"height":35},{"text":"시용될","x":976,"y":909,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1085,"y":910,"width":34,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1135,"y":910,"width":70,"height":34},{"text":"커널이","x":1225,"y":909,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"인터럽트","x":1343,"y":908,"width":130,"height":35}]},{"text":"핸들러에서도 A卜우되는 스핀락을 획득할 때 교착 상태의 원인이 발생할 수 있","words":[{"text":"핸들러에서도","x":384,"y":968,"width":178,"height":35},{"text":"A卜우되는","x":574,"y":967,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"스핀락을","x":704,"y":966,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"획득할","x":836,"y":966,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"때","x":939,"y":966,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"교착","x":981,"y":967,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"상태의","x":1056,"y":967,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"원인이","x":1168,"y":967,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"발생할","x":1280,"y":966,"width":102,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1394,"y":966,"width":34,"height":34},{"text":"있","x":1443,"y":966,"width":30,"height":34}]},{"text":"다. 락이 유지되는 동안 인터럽트가 발생하면 인터럽트 핸들러는 현재 락을 보","words":[{"text":"다.","x":382,"y":1025,"width":37,"height":34},{"text":"락이","x":433,"y":1025,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"유지되는","x":502,"y":1025,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"동안","x":632,"y":1024,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"인터럽트가","x":705,"y":1024,"width":149,"height":34},{"text":"발생하면","x":864,"y":1023,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"인터럽트","x":1000,"y":1024,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"핸들러는","x":1138,"y":1024,"width":133,"height":34},{"text":"현재","x":1283,"y":1024,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"락을","x":1363,"y":1023,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"보","x":1442,"y":1026,"width":32,"height":27}]},{"text":"유하고 있는 커널 코드를 선점한 다음 락을 획득하려고 시도하는 동안 루프를","words":[{"text":"유하고","x":381,"y":1082,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"있는","x":485,"y":1082,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"커널","x":555,"y":1081,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"코드를","x":626,"y":1082,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"선점한","x":729,"y":1081,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"다음","x":830,"y":1081,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"락을","x":904,"y":1081,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"획득하려고","x":977,"y":1081,"width":158,"height":35},{"text":"시도하는","x":1149,"y":1081,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"동안","x":1294,"y":1081,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"루프를","x":1376,"y":1082,"width":99,"height":34}]},{"text":"돌게 되므로 교착 상태가 발생한다. 이 상황을 피하기 위한 일반적인 전략은","words":[{"text":"돌게","x":380,"y":1140,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"되므로","x":455,"y":1139,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"교착","x":557,"y":1139,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"상태가","x":631,"y":1138,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"발생한다.","x":736,"y":1139,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":882,"y":1139,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"상황을","x":925,"y":1138,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"피하기","x":1035,"y":1138,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"위한","x":1145,"y":1139,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"일반적인","x":1228,"y":1139,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"전략은","x":1378,"y":1138,"width":99,"height":35}]},{"text":"인터럽트 처리기에서도 시용되는 스핀락을 얻기 전에 현재 프로세서에서 인터","words":[{"text":"인터럽트","x":382,"y":1197,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"처리기에서도","x":512,"y":1196,"width":178,"height":35},{"text":"시용되는","x":701,"y":119